==German==

===Etymology===
From {{inh|de|gmh|zickīn}}, from {{inh|de|goh|zickīn|t=kid}}, from {{inh|de|gem-pro|*tikkīną}} (compare Old English {{m|ang|tiċċen|t=kid}}), from {{der|de|ine-pro|*digós|t=goat}}, genitive of {{m|ine-pro|*díks}}. Cognate with obsolete English {{m|en|tick||a goat}}. More at {{m|de|Ziege}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|de|/ˈt͡sɪkə/}}
